{"duration_api_ms":6991,"stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"8077b925-5ba9-47eb-83ff-2893f5f7ec8f","total_cost_usd":0.0008554000000000001,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":697,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":1165,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":769},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":697,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1165,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation_input_tokens":697,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":697},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-5-5":{"inputTokens":1240,"outputTokens":1184,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":697,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.0008554000000000001,"contextWindow":1000000,"maxOutputTokens":128000,"thinkingTokens":769,"cacheCreationEphemeral5mInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationEphemeral1hInputTokens":697,"canonicalModel":"claude-haiku-5-5","provider":"firstParty","costBasis":"list"}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","fast_mode_disabled_reason":"sdk_opt_in_required","subagent_stats":{"spawned":0,"requested":{"background":0,"foreground":0,"unset":0},"started_in_background":0,"max_depth":0,"spawned_by_subagents":0,"completed":0,"failed":0,"killed":{"parent":0,"user":0,"system":0},"refused":{"depth_limit":0,"concurrency_limit":0,"budget":0},"by_type":{}},"safety_stops":0,"is_error":false,"num_turns":1,"subtype":"success","api_error_status":null,"result":"**Sponsor economics**\n- **Breakeven AUM:** estimated annual costs (admin, custody, audit, legal, licensing, distribution) divided by net fee after waivers. Track the gap between current AUM and this threshold.\n- **Waiver terms:** how long fee waivers or expense caps last, and the sponsor's willingness to keep absorbing costs.\n- **Sponsor scale:** fund count, shared overhead, and any history of closures.\n\n**Seed capital**\n- **Runway:** whether seed covers losses until breakeven at observed flow rates.\n- **Concentration:** whether a single seed holder controls a large share, since its redemption could trigger a sharp decline.\n- **Organic flows:** net flows excluding seed, to separate genuine demand from sponsor-supplied assets.\n\n**Market health**\n- Trading volume, bid-ask spreads, creation/redemption activity, and active authorized participants.\n- Platform access, such as wirehouse, RIA model portfolio, and brokerage inclusion.\n\nClosure under the 1940 Act requires board approval, so board minutes and filings (N-PORT, N-CEN, prospectus supplements) are useful early signals.","ttft_ms":4713,"type":"result","duration_ms":6387,"uuid":"17c33589-86ce-4545-ac6c-c4223cc602c6","ttft_stream_ms":477,"time_to_request_ms":88,"first_content_frame_ms":478,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0,"credential_expires_at":"2026-11-28T06:36:39.484Z"}
